DESCRIPTION:Runtime: 0 minutes\nRating: 0.0\nGenres: Fantasy\, Drama\, Comedy\, Thriller\n\nThis love story is an urban fable; the streets and tunnels would be empty. At the street corners\, traffic lights would turn on and off without any meaning. It’s an empty planet\, some would say. In a time yet to be named\, when the couple’s love crumbled in the dead of night during a blackout\, the planet became populated once more. To each other\, had they been nothing more than figments of the imagination? Would they ever see each other again? That man and that woman now wander through fragments of the real world\, seeking to piece their lives back together after the overwhelming experience of passion.\n\nTrailer: 
